OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud
OL,6,Fincreasing through the evening with
OL,7,Fthe potential for some showers
OL,8,Fpossible. A few showers possible this
OL,9,Fevening. Skies will gradually clear
OL,10,Fand becoming dry by the end of the
OL,11,Fnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FDry with plenty of sunshine on
OL,14,FMonday. Feeling warm in the strong
OL,15,Fsunshine, and a gentle breeze.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,18,FLargely dry next week with plenty of
OL,19,Fsunshine and light winds. Turning
OL,20,Fhotter and more humid from mid-week
OL,21,Fwith some very warm nights.
